Wrote the single row (deportation/HB 1393) to `coder-2.json`. Bascom authored and the state signed HB 1393 (2025), which requires jails to notify the sheriff when a felony/misdemeanor arrestee may be undocumented — a record, in-term, on-question passage, but its shape only establishes an enforcement-cooperation direction (broader than rung 2's "convicted of serious violent crimes," narrower than rungs 4/5's "all undocumented immigrants"), so the row is coded BLANK `direction-only`.
